order-box; font-size: small; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #888888;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #ff9900;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">2004&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span>8<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 9.75px; line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;\">th</span>&nbsp;National Exhibition, Lahore, Pakistan.</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: #666666; font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: small; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #888888;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #ff9900;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">2001&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span>Zainani Art Gallery, Karachi, Pakistan.</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: #666666; font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: small; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #888888;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #ff9900;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">2000&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span>Millennium Show at Ejaz Art Gallery, Lahore, Pakistan.</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: #666666; font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: small; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #888888;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #ff9900;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">1999&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span>Co-opera Art Gallery, Lahore, Pakistan.</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: #666666; font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; f