INSERT INTO `art_framerheaven` VALUES ('1a7f4bf2-0890-95fd-00b5-5a0194f5ef71','2017-11-07 11:10:09','2017-12-09 11:10:02','1','1','We have  New Glass Clarity by Larson Juhl for picture frames is water white and virtually invisible. With its amazing anti-glare and reflection characteristics, Clarity by Larson-Juhl is an immediate contender for use in displays requiring museum glass or art glass, where exhibits are required to be shown in optimum conditions.',0,'','Clarity Glass','clarity.jpg','jpg','image/jpeg','2017-11-07',NULL,'Product',NULL,NULL),('263d3216-a202-13e5-82f2-5a0196a477bb','2017-11-07 11:18:38','2017-12-09 11:16:54','1','1','People believe that foamcore is an excellent material to use for mounting or framing. Because of its wide use in the art world, even long time framers believe that \"acid free\" foamcore is an appropriate material to use for preservation purposes.\r\n\r\n',0,'','Foamcore','solid-wood-moulding-2.jpg','jpg','image/jpeg','2017-11-07',NULL,'Product',NULL,NULL),('3cc4ce43-9acb-2b78-fff5-5a0195eccdf7','2017-11-07 11:14:26','2018-06-06 07:56:32','97b43c6e-92d0-4d83-2487-58b6a6ca5907','1','People believe that Museum Glass® is a type of glazing — the only one that protects against UV radiation i.e. fading. They are unaware of the various options of 99% UV filtering glasses and acrylics (glazing) on the market.',0,'','Museum Glass','solid-wood-moulding-1.jpg','jpg','image/jpeg','2017-11-07',NULL,'Product',NULL,NULL),('5e089d6a-56dd-5769-e834-5a01a60457f6','2017-11-07 12:26:37','2017-12-09 11:16:50','1','1',NULL,0,'','Dry Mounting','dry-mounting.jpg','jpg','image/jpeg','2017-11-07',NULL,'Product',NULL,NULL),('8c847837-0593-b3d0-69ea-5a01a674892e','2017-11-07 12:27:13','2017-12-09 11:16:47','1','1',NULL,0,'','Cotton Rag Matting','cotton-rag-matting-1.jpg','jpg','image/jpeg','2017-11-07',NULL,'Product',NULL,NULL),('93844f80-1e57-d78a-bea0-5a01a60d42d3','2017-11-07 12:28:11','2017-12-09 11:16:44','1','1','Framers and others in the art industry use the term \"acid-free\" loosely without knowing its true meaning. Framers and framing companies are notorious in selling and using inferior products because they know that most will not know the materials and/or will never open their frame to see what is inside.',0,'','Acid Free','acid-mat-burn.jpg','jpg','image/jpeg','2017-11-07',NULL,'Product',NULL,NULL),('95c63f08-7a7f-b1b9-77e8-5a01a680fc6c','2017-11-07 12:25:42','2017-12-09 11:17:38','1','1','People believe that UV Filtering means 100% protection from Ultraviolet radiation (UVR), period. Most do not know or understand that UVR is a segment on the Electromagnetic spectrum i.e, a range of electromagnetic waves. Maximum Filtration should occur across the entire UV spectrum, not a single point.',1,NULL,'UV Filtering','uv-spectrum.png','png','image/png','2017-11-07',NULL,'Product',NULL,NULL),('aa61cc41-735c-ed2e-28ea-5a0194a56f6d','2017-11-07 11:11:07','2017-12-09 11:09:58','1','1','Mainframe has launched Newly,\r\nNewly is a totally new concept in the World of picture hanging and displaying systems.\r\nThe art of hanging art is art and your valuable pieces deserve the maximum attention, the way to do it is very important! The perfect combination between easiness, quality, and invisibility create the most suitable system for hanging and displaying!\r\nNewly offers a one-stop-shopping system which secures you via the latest developments a perfect solution, easy, safe and simple!',0,'','Newly Hanging System','newly.jpg','jpg','image/jpeg','2017-11-07',NULL,'Product',NULL,NULL),('b2773109-e9a8-7975-dc47-5a01962d31fd','2017-11-07 11:19:37','2017-12-09 11:16:52','1','1','Framing businesses use this term very broadly and inappropriately. The aim is to get you to buy their products believing they are high grade and therefore will protect your artwork from damage.',0,'','Conservation framing','cotton-rag-matting-1.jpg','jpg','image/jpeg','2017-11-07',NULL,'Product',NULL,NULL),('bf59b939-b624-726a-37d1-5a01a7f24ec1','2017-11-07 12:29:22','2018-05-07 06:44:48','1','1','Museum Quality, Museum Grade, and variations thereof are immensely overused terms in the framing industry. They are used, almost exclusively, as marketing terms without any actual merit to sell products.',0,'','Museum Quality','1223.jpeg','jpeg','image/jpeg','2017-11-07',NULL,'Product',NULL,NULL),('e7712246-e6bb-a8c4-d6b0-5a01943972b3','2017-11-07 11:11:50','2018-05-07 06:48:41','1','1','Protecting, Storing and transporting your precious artworks can now be easy, safe and secure without the need for disposable bubble wrap, tape and card. The Breen smART bag delivers the protection you need, takes up less space when packing and best of all you can reuse it again and again.\r\n• Re-sealable with a velcro strip • Strong & shock absorbent • Lined with a soft acid-free lining • Moisture absorbent • Mildew & mould repellent • Water Resistant • Insulating • Lightweight',0,'','Smart Bags','bags-1.jpg','jpg','image/jpeg','2017-11-07',NULL,'Product',NULL,NULL);
/*!40000 ALTER TABLE `art_framerheaven` ENABLE KEYS */;
UNLOCK TABLES;

